    <string name="diag_adas_doc_help">• Shell command: service call &lt;svc&gt; 2 i32 1000 i32 &lt;12|13&gt; s16 \"\"\n• Service: Auto_container on DL3/Di4 (PascalCase), auto_container on DL5+ (snake_case)\n• Code 12 = 显示Adas (Show ADAS) — emitted by clusterdebug.SecondActivity.infoListInit()\n• Code 13 = 关闭Adas (Hide ADAS) — same\n• Identical variants: DL3 (infoListInit), Di4 (infoListInit), DL5 (infoListInit_Di5)\n• R-series: codes 12/13 stripped (empty slots) — unsupported here</string>
    <string name="diag_sniffer_doc_content">• Initial header: ro.product.model, fingerprint, dumpsys display, dumpsys SurfaceFlinger, ps -A\n• Live: full logcat threadtime + events buffer (unfiltered, nothing missed)\n• Auto snapshots every 10 s: displays, SurfaceFlinger, BYD/xdja/qt/cluster processes\n• Manual snapshot: adds dumpsys window + broadcasts history\n• Persistence: capture survives Activity rotation/destruction (setsid process)</string>
    <string name="diag_sniffer_doc_workflow">1. Start → capture runs in the background (setsid, survives the Activity)\n2. Reproduce the bug / scenario under study\n3. Manual snapshot at key moments (e.g. just before/after crash)\n4. Stop\n5. Export → pick Telegram to share the file</string>
